'   - sort-part-lists-by-stock-number
'   - balloon-update Beta
'   - stock-number-to-balloon
'
' NOTE: The primary production engine remains executable. Additional source
' engines are embedded at the end as disabled reference modules to prevent
' duplicate Sub Main/Class/Imports compile collisions during staged integration.
' ============================================================================
