' BOM TOOL PRO BY HIẾU - MERGED RELEASE
' INTEGRATION: SMART STOCK NUMBER SORT (from sort-part-lists-by-stock-number.vb concept)
' MERGE: V23.1 COMPILE FIX + V29 SAFE ASSEMBLY SWITCH
' Inventor 2025 / iLogic
' Base: V29 Safe Assembly Switch (superset branch)
' Preserves shared Production Transaction / Performance / Validation core
'====================================================================

' USER REPORT IMPLEMENTATION - UI/UX PROFESSIONALIZATION + COMMAND ARCHITECTURE + SECONDARY FORMS
' BOM TOOL PRO MAX 10.3 SAFE ASSEMBLY SWITCH - FINAL HARDENING / RECOVERY / MANUFACTURING 2.0
' Upgraded from BOM TOOL PRO BY HIẾU (14)
' Inventor 2025 / iLogic compatibility baseline
' BOM TOOL PRO BY HIẾU 14.1 - PHASE 2 PRODUCTION TRANSACTION ENGINE
' Atomic Commit / Selected Commit / Operation Undo-Redo / Partial Commit Report / Batch Save Changed Docs
'====================================================================
' BOM TOOL PRO BY HIẾU - V13.3 PERFORMANCE CORE 2.0 
'====================================================================

'====================================================================
' V20 PHASE 1 CORE PERFORMANCE
' - Change Signature: path + LastWriteTimeUtc + FileSize + document Dirty
' - Smart Incremental Refresh: UNCHANGED lấy cache, CHANGED mới đọc lại
' - Root Assembly change detector: tự chuyển Full Reload để bắt NEW/REMOVED/QTY
' - Cache hit/miss + signature check + refresh timing monitor
' - Giữ Lazy Feature/Thumbnail engine hiện có
'====================================================================

